(
    title: "Gauntlet",
    description: Some("An explorer runs a hazard-strewn gauntlet on foot — jumping and ducking past rocks, logs, close-set trees and thrown tomahawks and arrows — to reach and douse the ceremonial fires ahead. Glasses of water serve as your lives: a stumble into any obstacle spends one, while each flame you put out refills them, so how deep you press is a gamble against the water you have left."),
